  "description": "Convalescing in the mountains after the war, wounded veteran Seo-Yun rescues an abandoned young wolf shifter and names him Yeon-Ho. Taking him in like a son, Seo-Yun slowly earns the distrustful boy’s devotion. But as Yeon-Ho matures under his tender care, his adoration curdles into something far more intense than family or duty. One afternoon, Seo-Yun accidentally catches Yeon-Ho in a moment of solitary pleasure - and the fragile boundary between guardian and ward shatters forever.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
